  "briefing": "Tidewater Consortium holds Madagascar through its tram depot. Reconnect 2 relays, download the records from the vault server, unlock the service gate, then leave by the exit. Expect 9 enemy agents and 4 guards on the streets.",
  "story": "Madagascar Audit: Tidewater Consortium runs Madagascar from its tram depot, and the district only notices when the lights go out. Your team has one night to reconnect the relays, download the records and walk out the exit.",
